    "description": "Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.\n\nThe Community You Will Join:\n\nWe are building tools and a global community to make it easier for people to host on Airbnb. Our team focuses on co-hosting and building intuitive, user-facing experiences that enable people to host together as a team, using machine learning where appropriate to address real user needs. The team works collaboratively with cross-functional partners in Design, Product Management, Business and other Engineering teams to quickly brainstorm, prototype, develop, and deliver high quality product experiences.\n\nThe Difference You Will Make:\n\nAs the Engineering Manager, within Guest & Host Services, you\u2019ll lead a team of talented, diverse software developers to prototype, build and improve hosting services, balancing the shorter term business outcomes along with longer term technical stability, scalability and flexibility aligning with cross functional partners.\n\nA Typical Day:\n\nExplore, shape, and develop new product experiences alongside cross-functional partners (design and product); from ideation to implementation at scale\n\nLead investments into new technical capabilities that push the envelope and unlock product innovation\n\nCollaborate with engineers to plan and sequence the delivery of new features and capabilities, making necessary trade-offs, while effectively communicating the delivery plans and celebrating successful launches\n\nPartner with peer engineering teams to integrate new features that impact different areas within the product\n\nStrengthen the team\u2019s partnerships with key stakeholders in Engineering, Design, and Product to make ambitious product feature concepts a reality.\n\nRecruit and nurture exceptional engineering talent by investing meaningful one-on-one time to understand their motivations and team dynamics, while also creating a tailored career development plan.\n\nFoster an inclusive team culture and environment that encourages collaboration, technical excellence, and innovation via calculated risks and product mindset.\n\nYour Expertise:\n\n5+ years of engineering ",
