    "description": "About the Team\n\nThe ChatGPT Space team is rethinking what work looks like when teams and agents can create together. We are building a shared workspace where a rough idea can become a polished, editable artifact, from Pages, Sheets, and Slides to entirely new kinds of work products.\n\nOur ambition is to build the best place for teams and agents to turn ideas into things they could not make alone. The work should keep evolving after the first draft, drawing on shared context, improving through collaboration, and staying current as a project moves forward.\n\nThis is a high-agency team working across product, design, and research. We partner closely with model training teams to shape how frontier models create and edit artifacts, then bring those capabilities into a coherent experience across Pages, files, and tools. The work spans full-stack product engineering, editing and rendering systems, model integration, and collaboration, with a high bar for taste, correctness, and speed.\n\nABOUT THE ROLE\n\nAs Engineering Manager, ChatGPT Space, you will lead and grow the product engineering team defining this experience. You will help shape both the product and the team that builds it, turning an ambitious, evolving vision into software people love to use.\n\nYou will partner with product and design on what great collaboration between teams and agents should feel like, with research on what models can create, and with infrastructure and enterprise partners on a dependable experience at scale.\n\nThis is a role for a leader who has built from zero to one and wants to help define a new category of work. You will bring the technical depth to guide hard decisions and the product judgment to know what is worth building, while developing engineers and giving them the clarity and autonomy to ship.\n\nThis role is based in San Francisco.\n\nIN THIS ROLE, YOU WILL\n\n- Lead, manage, and grow a product engineering team, creating clear ownership, supporting engineers\u2019 development, and hiring exceptional people\n\n- Partner with product and design to shape the ChatGPT Space roadmap and translate user needs into focused, well-crafted releases\n\n- Lead the development of creation, editing, and collaboration experiences for teams and agents, including tools that connect project context and keep work up to date\n\n- Set technical direction for full-stack product systems, editing and rendering surfaces,",
