    "description": "ABOUT PRIMER\n\nPrimer is a growing network of K\u20138 schools restoring the timeless foundations of American education. Inspired by the original teaching primers that shaped a nation of readers, thinkers, and builders, our schools begin with what has always worked, and build for what lies ahead. Close-knit learning environments. Skilled educators. A culture that takes kids seriously as learners and leaders.\n\nPrimers shaped the first 200 years of American children. Primer will ready them for the next.\n\nROLE OVERVIEW\n\nPrimer's goal is simple: fix K\u201312 education in America. We build schools from the ground up \u2014 and we run them on something nobody's built before: a single operating system for the entire school. We call it PrimerOS.\n\nIt covers real estate, teacher experience, parent experience, the most advanced academic program in the world, our back-office operating stack, and much more. We're looking for exceptional, multidisciplinary engineers to help build it. You'll redesign the school experience around modern technology and ship features that teachers, students, families, and state teams rely on every day. Based out of our sunny office in the Mission District of San Francisco 5 days/week.\n\nWHAT YOU\u2019LL DO\n\n- Work with TypeScript, Node, GraphQL, Prisma, Postgres, Next, React, and Relay. We invest heavily in our DevEx and agent stack.\n\n- Work daily with team members from engineering, product, design, academic program, and executive teams.\n\n- Take ownership of projects. You\u2019ll lead initiatives that shape the entire product, with room to learn and grow along the way.\n\n- Play a key role in setting the foundation for our engineering culture as we grow the team.\n\n- Build quality product. We set a high bar for quality, so expect to work hard to deliver excellence.\n\nWHAT WE'RE LOOKING FOR\n\n- You have an unbridled passion for fixing the US education system. This work is incredibly hard. But if we succeed, it will be the most fulfilling work of our lives. On the days and weeks that it feels like we\u2019re chewing glass, there are only two things that will get you through: a deep passion for fixing this problem, and looking around and seeing a team that shares that passion. We can guarantee the latter, but only you can guarantee the former.\n\n- The unknowns of the early-stage fuel you. You love rolling up your sleeves and figuring out what needs to happen.\n\n- You have a strong g",
