    "description": "Who we are\n\nAbout Stripe\n\nStripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies (from the world\u2019s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups) use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone\u2019s reach while doing the most important work of your career.\n\nAbout the team\n\nStripe is one of the fastest growing technology companies in the world, and we\u2019re scaling in every dimension: users, revenue, people, technology, processes, and more. The API Platform team is building the systems that support Stripe\u2019s API. We\u2019re looking for people passionate about distilling complexity across a breadth of problems, caring deeply about both our infrastructure and the experience of using our platform. We are major contributors to the latency, reliability, and efficiency of Stripe\u2019s API, and you\u2019ll be responsible for ensuring we maintain a reliable and secure platform.\n\nWhat you\u2019ll do\n\nThe API Platform is a unique environment where you\u2019ll be working on the business-critical infrastructure and constructs that are behind Stripe\u2019s products. This team owns the backbone that powers Stripe\u2019s APIs, Developer, and User Experiences. If making systems efficient, scalable, and reliable in a highly fast-paced environment is your bread and butter, then this job is for you.\n\nResponsibilities\n\nLead technical delivery and innovation for a team of talented engineers with a wide breadth of mission-critical ownership\n\nLead technical vision for core code across Stripe APIs and webhooks, used by all developers at Stripe. Focus on efficiency, usability, and product partner happiness.\n\nLead technical vision for deep infrastructure challenges across complex systems, ensuring best-in-class scaling, reliability, and efficiency.\n\nCoach a team of talented engineers, providing technical mentorship and support to ensure their success. Our staff engineers frequently find clever solutions to make the impossible possible, and to supercharge those around them to hit aggressive deadlines.\n\nOwn highly impactful projects independently and end-to-end, working across teams, organizations, and stakeholders to support the Infrastructure\u2019s key engineering",
