    "description": "ABOUT SUPABASE\n\nSupabase is the Postgres development platform, built by developers for developers. We provide a complete backend solution including Database, Auth, Storage, Edge Functions, Realtime, and Vector Search. All services are deeply integrated and designed for growth.\n\nABOUT THE ROLE\n\nWe're looking for an Engineering Manager to lead the Billing team at Supabase. Billing owns the monetization and revenue systems that turn platform usage into accurate customer charges and finance-ready revenue data. The team\u2019s scope includes plans, subscriptions, usage-based billing, invoices, payments, credits, coupons, taxation, dunning, collections, pricing mechanics, entitlements, marketplace and partner billing paths, and integrations with providers such as Stripe and Orb.\n\nBilling sits at the intersection of engineering, product, finance, data, support, and partnerships. The systems are revenue-critical and trust-critical: they must remain correct, predictable, supportable, observable, and extensible as Supabase grows and introduces new products, pricing models, and partner channels.\n\nThis is a people, delivery, and technical leadership role. We don\u2019t expect managers to contribute production code directly, but we do expect you to participate in architecture and design discussions, challenge plans with sound technical reasoning, and set a high bar for correctness, reliability, and operational maturity.\n\nWHAT YOU'LL BE RESPONSIBLE FOR\n\nTeam & People\n\n- Build a healthy, high-trust team culture in a remote-first, globally distributed environment.\n\n- Run 1:1s, performance management, career development, and onboarding for your direct reports.\n\n- Coach engineers working across backend application code, data pipelines, external integrations, and operational workflows.\n\n- Build durable ownership across the team so critical billing knowledge, access, and incident response do not depend on one person.\n\n- Handle people administration, including leave and time off, for your team.\n\nHiring\n\n- Own the hiring plan for the Billing team and act as Hiring Manager and first-round interviewer for roles on the team.\n\n- Partner with Talent Acquisition to source, interview, and close strong candidates with the right mix of billing-domain depth and engineering judgment.\n\n- Contribute to headcount planning, org design, and the evolution of engineering leadership at Supabase.\n\nDelivery, R",
